<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγένεια</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγενία</span></b>  (q. v.), ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nobility of birth</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				442
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1390b16
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμῶν εὐ. παίδων,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ εὐγενεῖς παῖδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				583
			</span></i> (lyr.): pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				279b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				618d
			</span></i>; <i>pure breeding</i>, of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενναιότης</span>
			, <i>nobleness</i> of mind, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				12.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				52.16
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> bodily
				<i>excellence</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τοῖς σώμασιν
				εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.6
			</span></i>; of materials, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.54
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>excellence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				49.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of style,
				<i>elevation, nobility</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				34.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> as a title, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εὐ. σου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGen.</u>
					1.50.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
